    "created_at": "2025-04-20T09:05:55Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-20T09:07:44Z",
    "body": "<del>There is kind of a more general problem here, which is that the relative order for all of https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/rendering.html is wrong. E.g. https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/rendering.html#hidden-elements comes before https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/rendering.html#flow-content-3 so in theory `<div hidden>` should be `display: block`. If I understand correctly.</del>\n\n<ins>No, I guess specificity saves us in that case.</ins>",
